('FR000081', 'FIR-2024-0079', 'CS000067', 'On 13-Jul-2024 complainant Bishakha Mishra lodged a complaint of unauthorized digital transactions at Kajamalai Junction, Tiruchchirappalli. The accused Zayyan Mohan (alias Pickle36) and Bhavika Halder obtained OTPs via fraudulent calls from phone 8608283898, drained A/C XXXX5123 and transferred funds to controlled mule accounts. On 06/07/2024 the suspect used vehicle registration TN01 BB 2764 near the cyber park exit. FIR Number FIR-2024-0079 under Case Number CASE-0067, offences under Section 66D IT Act read with Section 66D IT Act. The matter was assigned to acp rajesh menon.', '2024-07-24T00:46:13Z', 'LOC000005', 'SYNTHETIC', '2026-09-07T05:41:13.368867Z'),
